      "message": "`FpFrameSizeCacheTestHelper` acts purely as a scoping mechanism for static helper functions. Since it contains no member variables and isn\u0027t meant to be instantiated, it\u0027s a good practice to explicitly prevent object creation.\n\n**Suggestion:** Delete the default constructor.\n\n```cpp\nclass FpFrameSizeCacheTestHelper {\npublic:\n    FpFrameSizeCacheTestHelper() \u003d delete; // Prevent instantiation\n\n    static void set_frame_size(FpFrameSizeCache \u0026cache,\n                               enum fp_capture_type capture_type,\n                               uint32_t size)\n    {\n        // ...\n    }\n};\n\n```",
